Package: ChloroMarker
Type: Shiny
Title: Chloroplast Diagnostic Marker and Assay Designer
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Nan", "Hu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Parses annotated chloroplast genomes, ranks diagnostic genes and
    intergenic regions, designs degenerate primers, predicts gel and PCR-RFLP
    profiles, produces distance matrices, and recommends escalation when
    chloroplast markers are insufficient.
